        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Mark Huffam, Mike Jefferies, Matt Barrelle\n- Works: The Martian, Johnny English, Game of Thrones, Goal!\n- Companies: Buena Vista Pictures\n- Topics: Film and television production\n\nFacts:\n- Mark Huffam is a film and television producer.\n- Johnny English is a 2003 British-American spy comedy film that parodies the James Bond secret agent genre and uses comedy similar to Mr. Bean.\n- Mark Huffam was a producer on Johnny English.\n- Mark Huffam, Mike Jefferies, and Matt Barrelle produced the film Goal!.\n- Buena Vista Pictures distributed Goal!.\n- Mark Huffam was a producer on the television series Game of Thrones.\n- Mark Huffam was a producer on The Martian.",
